  "body": "**Remove:** 3rd Party IDs (3PIDs) such as email addresses, phone numbers, Facebook accounts to authenticate, identify and discover users on Matrix. \r\n\r\n## will solve the following problems ##\r\n* I have an account with **element**, but **Homeserver** is blocked, I have to go to a new **Homeserver** to create an account, which will cause all my contacts and groups to be gone,\r\n\r\n* All federated **Homeserver** must sync account keys, I don't need to go to a new **Homeserver** to re-register an account,\r\nI only need to enter the key in the new **Homeserver** to log in, and my contacts and groups still exist. This also solves the problem that **Homeserver** does not open user registration\r\n\r\n* **Homeserver** blockage is severe In countries (China Iran North Korea etc.), the only solution users must use VPN but VPN is very expensive. Maybe matrix can build a network similar to [Tor Snowflake](https://snowflake.torproject.org/)",
